        "related_files": [
          "src/weewx_ha/controller.py",
          "src/weewx_ha/utils.py"
        ],
        "evidence": [
          "Controller.check_config_update reads a future's bool and submits publish_discovery to the executor (a side effect), unlike check_future_errors which only logs.",
          "_LAMBDA_REGISTRY['localtime_to_utc_timestamp'] = datetime.fromtimestamp(x, tz=utc).timestamp(), an identity on the epoch (verified 1700000000 -> 1700000000.0); 'localtime_to_iso' likewise formats a UTC epoch. These names are also public YAML keys in sensors.yaml.",
